{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARVEST CROPS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/7eeb8dd0fd6da33ff4e4c6fa3e651ebe.poster.avif?t=1760727804\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/7eeb8dd0fd6da33ff4e4c6fa3e651ebe.webm?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/7eeb8dd0fd6da33ff4e4c6fa3e651ebe.mp4?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, slash, or shoot through waves of crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just hover over them and your weapon does the rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/fb8a4c3d749fb2556b0b89cbeb59821c.poster.avif?t=1760727804\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/fb8a4c3d749fb2556b0b89cbeb59821c.webm?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/fb8a4c3d749fb2556b0b89cbeb59821c.mp4?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy powerful farming gear and rare seeds to prepare for the next harvest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEED THE KING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/d3c4956f7a5f4faf449f567916d43484.poster.avif?t=1760727804\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/d3c4956f7a5f4faf449f567916d43484.webm?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/d3c4956f7a5f4faf449f567916d43484.mp4?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your harvested crops to the King and fill his endless hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each feast earns you Crowns used for permanent upgrades</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/3a021de991b68cbc0e4cfe364f57c106.poster.avif?t=1760727804\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/3a021de991b68cbc0e4cfe364f57c106.webm?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/extras/3a021de991b68cbc0e4cfe364f57c106.mp4?t=1760727804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your Crowns to unlock powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger every run and shape your perfect farming build.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045540?t=1760727804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/be5fcd56635bc90c478d709e9dea009b1ac9bd7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760727804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/59d0de503513b525d6cbb820f185fd768ef4b2e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760727804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045540/59d0de503513b525